# The FM engine: picked with ALGORITHM; its knobs are on the Engine page (HOME again). Breath still opens our filter on
# it, and a Mod slot can send breath to its index (Timbre).
wait 200
tap HOME
expect view 1
spin ALGO 1
expect par30 1
expect par31 24
expect par32 40
wait 100
shot fm_engine.png
spin ALGO -1
expect par30 0
spin ALGO 1
expect par30 1
midi 90 39 64
breath 0 127 50
wait 50
expect gate 1
expect cutoff 90
expect timbre 40
expect level >5
peakreset
breath 127 10 50
wait 60
breath 10 10 10
expect cutoff <30
# Mod 2: breath to Timbre (FM's index)
tap SEL
tap SEL
expect view 7
spin K1 1
spin K2 4
spin K3 50
expect par16 4
breath 10 127 50
wait 30
expect timbre 90
midi 80 39 00
wait 200
